#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1185
#: includes/class-admin.php:1185
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1187
#: includes/class-admin.php:1187
msgid "Privacy by Design"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1188
#: includes/class-admin.php:1188
msgid "Rich Statistics does not store personally identifiable information. Sessions are identified by a UUID stored in sessionStorage (not cookies) that is cleared when the browser tab closes. IP addresses are never stored. Referrer URLs are truncated to domain only."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1189
#: includes/class-admin.php:1189
msgid "If a visitor's browser has Do Not Track (DNT) or Global Privacy Control (GPC) enabled, the tracker exits immediately — no session is created and no data is sent."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1190
#: includes/class-admin.php:1190
msgid "Because no PII is collected, most sites using Rich Statistics do not require a cookie consent banner for the analytics data collected by this plugin. Always consult a qualified lawyer for advice specific to your situation."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1200
#: includes/class-admin.php:1200
msgid "Overview Dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1201
#: includes/class-admin.php:1201
msgid "The overview shows your total pageviews, unique sessions, average time on page, and bounce rate for the selected period. The daily chart lets you spot traffic trends at a glance."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1202
#: includes/class-admin.php:1202
msgid "Use the period selector (top right) to switch between Last 7 days, Last 30 days, Last 90 days, This month, and Last month."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1203
#: includes/class-admin.php:1203
msgid "Bounce rate"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1203
#: includes/class-admin.php:1203
msgid "is calculated as the percentage of sessions that viewed only a single page."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1209
#: build/stage/rich-statistics/templates/admin/overview.php:83
#: includes/class-admin.php:1209
#: templates/admin/overview.php:83
msgid "Top Pages"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1210
#: includes/class-admin.php:1210
msgid "This view ranks every page on your site by the number of pageviews in the selected period. The average time on page is shown for each URL."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1211
#: includes/class-admin.php:1211
msgid "Page paths are stored after stripping query parameters that appear to contain personal data (email-shaped values or strings longer than 40 characters)."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1217
#: includes/class-admin.php:1217
msgid "Audience Breakdown"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1218
#: includes/class-admin.php:1218
msgid "Operating system, browser name, browser version, viewport size, language, and timezone are detected from the browser environment using JavaScript and stored as non-identifying aggregate categories."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1219
#: includes/class-admin.php:1219
msgid "Viewport buckets: Mobile (≤480px), Tablet (481–1024px), Desktop (>1024px)."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1220
#: includes/class-admin.php:1220
msgid "Language codes follow the BCP 47 standard as reported by navigator.language (e.g. en-US, fr-FR, de)."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1226
#: includes/class-admin.php:1226
msgid "Referrer Tracking"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1227
#: includes/class-admin.php:1227
msgid "Only the referring domain is stored — never the full URL. This prevents leaking of personal data that might appear in referrer URLs (e.g. search queries, email campaign tokens)."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1228
#: includes/class-admin.php:1228
msgid "Direct traffic, bookmark visits, and traffic from HTTPS sites to your HTTP site appear as \"(direct)\" because browsers do not send a Referer header in these cases."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1234
#: includes/class-admin.php:1234
msgid "UTM Campaign Tracking"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1235
#: includes/class-admin.php:1235
msgid "Campaigns are tracked automatically when visitors land on your site with UTM parameters in the URL (utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign). The values are captured from the landing-page URL and attributed to every pageview in that browser session."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1236
#: includes/class-admin.php:1236
msgid "Use the Medium filter to isolate traffic from a specific channel (e.g. email, cpc, social)."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1242
#: includes/class-admin.php:1242
msgid "Behavior Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1243
#: includes/class-admin.php:1243
msgid "Time on page is measured using the Visibility API — the timer pauses when the visitor switches tabs and resumes when they return. The value is sent when the page is closed via the Beacon API."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1244
#: includes/class-admin.php:1244
msgid "Session depth shows how many pages most visitors view in a single session. Entry pages lists the pages where most sessions start."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1250
#: includes/class-admin.php:1250
msgid "User Flow Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1251
#: includes/class-admin.php:1251
msgid "The Path Explorer shows page-to-page navigation in Miller columns. Each column is one step in the journey — click any page to drill forward and see where visitors went next. A drop-off funnel above the columns shows how many sessions reached each step."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1252
#: includes/class-admin.php:1252
msgid "Percentages in each column are relative to the selected page in the previous column, so they reflect \"of visitors who reached this page, N% continued to…\". Switch to the Journey Table view to browse every recorded page pair with counts and percentages."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1256
#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1258
#: includes/class-admin.php:1256
#: includes/class-admin.php:1258
msgid "Click Tracking (Premium)"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1259
#: includes/class-admin.php:1259
msgid "Click tracking captures non-navigational interactions: phone links (tel:), email links (mailto:), map links (geo:), SMS links (sms:), and file downloads. HTTP/HTTPS link navigation is tracked automatically as pageviews. You can add additional element IDs and CSS classes in Preferences."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1260
#: includes/class-admin.php:1260
msgid "The Destination column shows the actual value supplied to the protocol handler: the phone number for tel: links, the email address for mailto: links, the coordinates for geo: links, the SMS number for sms: links, and the file path or URL for downloads."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1261
#: includes/class-admin.php:1261
msgid "Click tracking uses event delegation — no inline event handlers are added to the page."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1265
#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1267
#: includes/class-admin.php:1265
#: includes/class-admin.php:1267
msgid "Heatmap (Premium)"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1268
#: includes/class-admin.php:1268
msgid "The heatmap displays a dark canvas showing scroll-depth guide lines and click-hotspot dots for any tracked page. Dot colour ranges from cool blue (few clicks) to hot red (many clicks). Hover a dot to see which DOM elements were clicked at that position. Coordinates are stored as viewport-relative percentages so the heatmap works at any screen size."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1269
#: includes/class-admin.php:1269
msgid "The side panel lists the top-clicked elements with a click bar chart — useful for identifying links and buttons that get the most engagement."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1270
#: includes/class-admin.php:1270
msgid "Use the Period selector to change the date range. Custom start/end dates are supported. Raw click coordinates are aggregated into a 2% grid nightly by a background cron task to keep storage efficient."
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1274
#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1276
#: includes/class-admin.php:1274
#: includes/class-admin.php:1276
msgid "WooCommerce Analytics (Premium)"
msgstr ""

#: build/stage/rich-statistics/includes/class-admin.php:1277
#: includes/class-admin.php:1277
msgid "Automatically tracks product views, add-to-cart events (standard and AJAX), and order completions. Surfaces a conversion funnel, top products table, and a revenue-over-time chart."
msgstr ""

